WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Annual salary divided into suites

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,400
Those so-called rich second generations who were chasing me before yesterday should just get out of here.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,600
If you make 20,000 yuan a month, you want to chase me

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,800
I now own a house, a car and a deposit

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,200
Why do you look at their faces?

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
I used to think that those early managers with annual salaries of hundreds of thousands were quite good.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Now compare with our young and handsome boss

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,600
It's worse than stinking shit

9
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,800
Each tone is louder than the last

10
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,200
Even the suitors turned into stinky shit.

11
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,000
This mask is so hydrating

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,860
My skin seems really brightened, right?

13
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:29,860
Why don't I see any difference, boss?

14
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,060
Didn’t you go hunting for treasure deep in the mountains?

15
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,260
Why are there no footsteps at all?

16
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,260
Just jump in

17
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,660
A wall more than ten meters high

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,660
I just jumped in and walked in.

19
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,860
What we danced and said just now

20
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:40,860
you heard it all

21
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,060
What do you think?

22
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:45,260
They are taking pictures of my boss from behind one by one. I'm so brave. I'm sorry, boss.

23
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,040
We immediately said it was OK
